---
title: "Adding an item"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: error
    lg1: done
    lg2: active
  }
  class lg0 orange
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 blue
  s0: Empty form
  s1: Title typed
  s2: Saving (button disabled)
  s3: Request failed, toast shown, title kept
  s4: Error shown, your title kept
  s5: New item listed, toast shown
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you type a title or you type only spaces
  s1 --> s2: you press Add
  s2 --> s3: the request fails
  s2 --> s5: the item is saved
  s2 --> s4: the server rejects the blank title or the item limit is reached
  s3 --> s2: you press Add
  s3 --> s1: you type a title or you type only spaces
  s4 --> s1: you type a title or you type only spaces
  s4 --> s2: you press Add
  s5 --> s1: you type a title or you type only spaces
  class s0 blue
  class s1 blue
  class s3 orange
  class s4 orange
  class s5 teal
